---
import FactoryScene from './FactoryScene.astro';
import '../../styles/monkey-factory.css';
---
<section class="monkey-factory" data-monkey-factory aria-labelledby="factory-heading">
  <div class="factory-intro">
    <p class="factory-eyebrow">The judgement factory</p>
    <h1 id="factory-heading">The machine works.<br />The monkey decides.</h1>
    <p>An ingenious apparatus turns bananas into bread. The final loaf waits for a small act of judgement.</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="factory-figure" aria-describedby="factory-description">
    <div class="factory-stage">
      <picture class="factory-still">
        <source media="(max-width: 640px)" srcset="/images/judgement-factory/mobile.webp" width="1345" height="1169" />
        <img src="/images/judgement-factory/desktop.webp" width="1983" height="793" fetchpriority="high"
          alt="A hand-drawn miniature banana-bread factory: whole yellow bananas climb to a peeler, skins drop into a hanging basket, a pulley drives a mixer and an oven bakes the loaf. Tiny monkey workers supervise. At the end, an inspector holds the loaf behind a stop before releasing it with a lever." />
      </picture>
      <div class="factory-live" hidden>
        <FactoryScene id="factory-desktop" />
        <FactoryScene id="factory-mobile" mobile />
      </div>
      <div class="factory-hotspots" hidden aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="factory-machine-area" data-hover="mixer"></div>
        <div class="factory-worker-area" data-hover="worker"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figcaption id="factory-description">Whole bananas → peeling → mixing → baking → inspection → release. Machines handle repetition. The inspector owns the final release.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="factory-controls" hidden>
    <div class="factory-control-row" role="group" aria-label="Factory playback">
      <button type="button" data-control="play" aria-pressed="false">Pause animation</button>
      <button type="button" data-control="hold" aria-pressed="false">Hold next loaf</button>
      <button type="button" data-control="approve">Approve loaf</button>
      <button type="button" data-control="boost" aria-pressed="false">Boost mixer</button>
      <button type="button" data-control="worker">Check intake</button>
    </div>
    <p class="factory-status" data-status role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">The factory is running. Each loaf pauses for inspection.</p>
    <p class="factory-hint">Try holding a loaf, then approve its release. Hover the mixer or use “Boost mixer” for a small local speed change.</p>
  </div>
  <noscript><p class="factory-hint">This still shows the complete process. The loaf is held at inspection; motion and controls are available with JavaScript.</p></noscript>
</section>
<script>
  import { mountFactories } from '../../scripts/factory-animation';
  mountFactories();
</script>
